      "id": "EZK.15.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Son of man, What is the vine-tree more than any tree, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or than",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a branch which is among the trees of the forest?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Shall wood be taken of it to do any work? or will ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "men",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " take a pin of it to hang any vessel upon it?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, it is cast into the fire for fuel; the fire devoureth both the ends of it, and the midst of it is burned. Is it suitable for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " work?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Behold, when it was whole, it was fit for no work: how much less then shall it be fit for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " work, when the fire hath devoured it, and it is burned?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord GOD; As the vine-tree among the trees of the forest, which I have given to the fire for fuel, so will I give the inhabitants of Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will set my face against them; they shall go out from ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "one",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fire, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "another",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " fire shall devour them; and ye shall know that I ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "am",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, when I set my face against them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZK.15.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZK.15.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I will make the land desolate, because they have committed a trespass, saith the Lord GOD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
